.153, "end": 23.034, "text": "A few errands, then work from home."}, {"start": 23.615, "end": 24.375, "text": "Nothing dramatic."}, {"start": 24.975, "end": 26.256, "text": "Then we will keep this brief."}, {"start": 27.257, "end": 28.797, "text": "How are you feeling in yourself today?"}, {"start": 29.478, "end": 29.738, "text": "Well..."}, {"start": 30.258, "end": 31.259, "text": "No complaints at all."}, {"start": 31.879, "end": 32.079, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 32.74, "end": 33.8, "text": "I will give the vaccine now."}, {"start": 34.381, "end": 34.841, "text": "Go ahead."}, {"start": 35.662, "end": 35.902, "text": "Done."}, {"start": 37.583, "end": 38.123, "text": "Efficient."}, {"start": 38.804, "end": 39.464, "text": "Any reaction?"}, {"start": 40.045, "end": 40.525, "text": "Soreness?"}, {"start": 40.885, "end": 41.546, "text": "Lightheadedness?"}, {"start": 42.246, "end": 42.767, "text": "None at all."}, {"start": 43.087, "end": 44.628, "text": "I feel completely well."}, {"start": 45.228, "end": 48.07, "text": "Then the vaccination is given, with no complications."}, {"start": 48.711, "end": 48.951, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 49.711, "end": 51.212, "text": "Anything else on the agenda today?"}, {"start": 51.873, "end": 52.573, "text": "One reminder."}, {"start": 53.154, "end": 55.935, "text": "Your foot check and your eye check are coming up."}, {"start": 56.496, "end": 57.076, "text": "Both of them."}, {"start": 57.777, "end": 58.037, "text": "Right."}, {"start": 58.357, "end": 59.518, "text": "I will make sure they are booked."}, {"start": 60.118, "end": 60.638, "text": "Please do."}, {"start": 61.319, "end": 62.86, "text": "That is everything from my side."}, {"start": 63.44, "end": 63.86, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 64.44, "end": 67.202, "text": "Then I will take the bike in for a service on the way home."}, {"start": 67.842, "end": 68.843, "text": "Something wrong with it?"}, {"start": 69.443, "end": 70.464, "text": "The gears, mainly."}, {"start": 71.064, "end": 72.325, "text": "It is overdue anyway."}, {"start": 72.905, "end": 73.505, "text": "Good luck with it."}, {"start": 74.166, "end": 74.526, "text": "Take care."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 1.63}}